        <section>
            <h2>National Industrial Code for Udyam Registration</h2>
            <p>
                NIC 2008 is designed keeping in mind the International System of Classification and due to this,
                the Udyam registration process complies with government norms and works smoothly.
            </p>
            <p>
                The National Industrial Classification Code ('NIC Code') is a statistical standard that provides for
                the creation and maintenance of comparable data on various economic activities. This code was
                created because it determines and evaluates how each economic activity contributes to the
                national wealth of the country.
            </p>
            <p>
                Here you will learn all the important things about NIC Code for Udyam Registration.
            </p>
            <p>
                If you need any help regarding Udyam Registration then click on <a href="<?php echo $baseUrl; ?>">Register Udyam</a>
                and fill out the form.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>What is the NIC Code for Udyam Registration?</h2>
            <p>
                The Government of India has created a standardized system for classifying businesses and
                economic activities called the National Industrial Classification (NIC) Code. This code is used by
                various government departments and agencies to classify and identify enterprises based on
                their activities.
            </p>
            <p>
                Under Udyam Registration, the National Industrial Classification (NIC) Code is divided into
                specific categories and defines each category from where the business operates. MSMEs must
                provide NIC Code during the Udyam Registration process as it ensures that the business falls
                under which classification of MSMEs as per the eligibility criteria prescribed by the government.
            </p>
        </section>

