        <section>
            <h2>Importance of the NIC Code for Udyam Registration</h2>
            <p>
                NIC code plays a very important role in the Udyam registration process. Here are some reasons
                why NIC code is important:
            </p>
            <ol>
                <li><strong>Accurate classification:</strong> With the help of NIC code, you can know whether your business is
                    running according to its operation or not, so that any misrepresentation can be avoided.
                </li>
                <li><strong>Sector-specific benefits:</strong> Many government schemes are sector-specific for industries. If the
                    businesses use the NIC code correctly, they can get the benefits related to their sector.
                </li>
                <li><strong>Data Analytics:</strong> With the help of NIC code, the government and policymakers can analyze
                    the data of various MSME enterprises thoroughly and can do better resource allocation and
                    planning for them.
                </li>
                <li><strong>Ease of doing business:</strong> NIC code simplifies many long-drawn processes like applying for
                    loans, tenders, or subsidies by properly and accurately identifying your industry.
                </li>
            </ol>
        </section>

